answer(68,p('For identical masses, F = Gm²/r², so m = √(Fr²/G).','m = √[(5.5 × 10⁻⁷¹)(1.0)²/(6.67 × 10⁻¹¹)] = <strong>9.1 × 10⁻³¹ kg</strong>. This is their gravitational attraction; the much stronger electrical force is not the force being calculated.'))
