answer(78,p('<strong>The printed “applied force of 27.0 cm” is dimensionally invalid.</strong> If the intended force is 27.0 N, then k = 12 N/3.0 cm = 4.0 N/cm and x = 27.0/4.0 = <strong>6.75 cm ≈ 6.8 cm</strong>.','If instead the intended question asks for the force required to stretch the spring 27.0 cm, F = (4.0 N/cm)(27.0 cm) = <strong>108 N</strong>.'))
